### Get all contacts
GET http://localhost:3000

###

### Get a single contact by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/contacts/69ac8fcec0af682e7e5cc63e


### Create a new contact
POST http://localhost:3000
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "email": "john.doe@example.com",
  "favoriteColor": "Red",
  "birthday": "2001-07-12"
}

### Update an existing contact
PUT http://localhost:3000/contacts/69ac8fcec0af682e7e5cc63e
